ng awesome like i say this  isn't the same thing as super functional  training which is still available  as an e-book and that includes a full  program and diet advice it's a very  different beast  whereas functional training and beyond  is a book it'll take you from  beginning to end and it's published by a  proper publishing company  mango which have been fantastic at every  stage of the way  and that also means of course that it's  nicely edited it's got a cool cover  design  and the stuff they've done with it looks  really great it's a huge and  comprehensive book if you enjoy any of  the stuff on this channel  then you'll find something to enjoy in  there it's currently available for  pre-order  check it out i'll put a link to the  amazon listing in the description down  below and that's the other thing of  course you're not buying it from my  website so you don't need paypal you can  buy it through amazon and you can just  use all the methods that you're  used to or deliver to anywhere and of  course all those people that don't enjoy  reading ebooks on a little screen it is  available on kindle but it's also  available  in a physical format and i'll be sharing  more about this book  over the coming weeks and months in the  build up to it i'll be doing an unboxing  i'll be reading chapters from it and  discussing some of these subjects that  crop up so  stay tuned for that stuff there's also  some other exciting new announcements  coming to the channel so  keep your eyes peeled for those and i  will see you then  in the meantime back to our regular  programming i'm just out here right now  filming some workout footage from my  next video  which is all about bucky training so if  that sounds cool then please subscribe  thanks again so much for your support  like this video etc etc  thanks a ton and bye for now  you
 

